# ── COLD KEYS. Never committed, never in .env, never read at runtime. ──────────
# The cold owner EOA for the ERC-8004 agent identities lives here. It is the root
# of trust for the agent registry: whoever holds it OWNS the agents. It is
# deliberately NOT in .env, because .env is loaded by the app and mirrored into
# Netlify env — a key that no running code path can reach cannot be leaked by one.
# Broad patterns, so a future key file cannot miss the net by being named slightly
# differently.
.keys/
*.key
*.privkey
cold-owner*.json
